 "result_text": "The `RecursionError` is fixed. Your example now runs, and `C.from_dict({\"x\": 1}).to_dict()` returns `{'x': 1}`.\n\nI couldn't run the test suite. Collection fails with 23 errors, both with and without my change. The one I looked at was an unsupported `typing_extensions.NoDefault`, which looks like an environment problem.\n\n**Cause:** a field-level `serialization_strategy` with `use_annotations=True` was applied again to the type found in the strategy's annotation. Your `Any` annotation matched the same field-level strategy, and that repeated without end.\n\n**Fix:** when resolving the annotated type, the nested spec now drops `serialization_strategy` from the field metadata. I made this change in `_pack_with_annotated_serialization_strategy` in `mashumaro/core/meta/types/pack.py` and in `_unpack_with_annotated_serialization_strategy` in `mashumaro/core/meta/types/unpack.py`.\n\nNothing is committed and no tests were added.",
